      Focal Shape Size: 0.02500000037252903
      Invert Z Axis: false
      Name: Current View
      Near Clip Distance: 0.009999999776482582
      Pitch: 0.07000003010034561
      Target Frame: <Fixed Frame>
      Value: Orbit (rviz)
      Yaw: 0.030000019818544388
    Saved: ~
